sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Vendor as Prospective Vendor
    participant Client as Frontend (React UI)
    participant Backend as Express Server / API
    participant DB as SQLite DB
    actor Officer as PSU Procurement Officer
    participant Blockchain as Sepolia Blockchain (OilTenderingV1)

    Note over Vendor,Client: Step 1: Document Upload & Application Submission
    Vendor->>Client: Input Company Name, GSTIN, PAN, KYC Doc
    Client->>Backend: GET /api/ipfs/nonce
    Backend-->>Client: Returns cryptographically random nonce
    Client->>Client: Sign nonce via MetaMask (EIP-1193)
    Client->>Backend: POST /api/ipfs/upload (File + signature + wallet)
    Backend->>Backend: Verify signature matches wallet
    Backend-->>Client: Returns IPFS CID (Pinata)
    Client->>Backend: POST /api/vendors/apply (Wallet, Name, GSTIN, PAN, CID)
    Backend->>Backend: Strict Regex Check (GSTIN, PAN, Address)
    Backend->>DB: INSERT INTO vendor_applications (Status='PENDING')
    Backend-->>Client: 201 Created (Application ID)

    Note over Officer,Backend: Step 2: Officer Review & On-Chain Approval
    Officer->>Client: Log in with credentials & 2FA
    Client->>Backend: POST /api/auth/login
    Backend-->>Client: Bearer JWT
    Officer->>Client: Navigate to /officer/vendors
    Client->>Backend: GET /api/vendors/applications (Bearer JWT)
    Backend->>DB: SELECT * FROM vendor_applications
    DB-->>Backend: List of applications
    Backend-->>Client: Return Pending Applications
    Officer->>Client: Click 'Approve Application'
    Client->>Backend: POST /api/vendors/applications/:id/approve (Bearer JWT)
    Backend->>Backend: Compute keccak256(GSTIN), keccak256(PAN)
    Backend->>Blockchain: eth_sendTransaction: registerVendor(wallet, gstinHash, panHash, kycCid)
    Blockchain-->>Backend: Transaction Receipt (txHash, BlockNumber)
    Backend->>DB: UPDATE vendor_applications SET status='APPROVED', tx_hash=txHash
    Backend-->>Client: 200 OK (Approved)

    Note over Vendor,Blockchain: Step 3: Status Query & Verification
    Vendor->>Client: Check Registration Status
    Client->>Backend: GET /api/vendors/status/:address
    Backend->>Blockchain: call vendors(address).isApproved
    Backend->>DB: SELECT status FROM vendor_applications
    Backend-->>Client: Returns status="APPROVED", onChainApproved=true
